    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "中西小說賞析",
    "sub_ename": "FICTION: INTERPRETATION AND\rAPPRECIATION",
    "describe_ch": "引導學生閱讀中西重要小說文本理解中國現代小說發展的軌跡與相關外緣社會歷史文化論述，掌握文本背後的種種對於人性、道德，以及歷史社會文化的重要意涵，成為更具人文素養的大學生。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will introduce Chinese-major students to reading important modern Chinese and Western fictional work to understand the development of Chinese fiction and its related social, historical, and cultural contexts and discourses. The aims are to prepare students to understand fictional texts, the underlying human nature, morality, and historical-socio-cultural significance and become students with humanistic concerns.",
